WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.890
Mitsunari.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:07.070
I would like to try fighting you as well.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.940
Then we will do it here.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.450
Yes.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.740
It is a promise.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.410
There is no going back to that time anymore.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.750
This is goodbye.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.550
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.930
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.720
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.180
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.650
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.820
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.480
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.940
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.360
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:58.620
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.830
<b>So fast!</b>

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.120
<b>Break out!</b>

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:17.390
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:23.930
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:28.600
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.860
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.780
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:48.500
<i>Tokugawa Ieyasu and Ishida Mitsunari
once fought together as sworn friends</i>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.180
<i>and gave rise to this enormous
chasm across the valley of Sekigahara.</i>

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.470
<i>Over time,</i>

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:59.270
<i>it became a symbol of how the land
of the rising sun was divided in two.</i>

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.680
<i>And now...</i>

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.110
<i>Upon this land of a promise made,</i>

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:09.150
<i>the battle to claim the country has begun.</i>

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:16.030
Sekigahara

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.540
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.540
Western Forces

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.040
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.040
Eastern Forces

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.930
Those are some crazy numbers, Kojuro.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:37.050
Yes, Sir.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.220
A battle to draw this
many generals onto the field

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.930
must surely be unprecedented.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.390
This is what you wanted.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.320
The era that I want lies beyond this battle.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.280
Beyond Ishida Mitsunari's defeat.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.450
Yes.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.040
<i>I won't lose my way again.</i>

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.210
<i>After I've squared things away with Ishida,</i>

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.630
<i>it'll be my match with you!</i>

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:11.800
<i>Isn't that right,</i>

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.550
<i>Sanada Yukimura?</i>

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.550
What's wrong, Master?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.220
No...

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.050
Right now, rather than
concerning myself with individuals,

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.140
I must focus upon the
course of this great battle.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:28.190
You're looking like our lord there, Commander.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.820
<i>Proving myself to be greater
than Lord Ieyasu in this battle</i>

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:35.240
<i>will be the act that will avenge my lord.</i>

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:39.200
<i>And awaiting me at the end of my path...</i>

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.580
<i>...is you, Lord Masamune.</i>

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:53.250
Just a little longer, Ieyasu.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:57.800
Just a little longer before your
blood rains down upon this land.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.850
But to take position in the center,
where they are half encircled...

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.930
Is it daring or a lack of wits?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.520
It is a sign of their resolve
to neither run nor hide.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.400
Does he mean to claim
that his conscience is clear?

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.900
Very well!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.780
I will cloud that clarity with crimson!

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.070
Come, Ieyasu!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.540
Advance detachment, forward!

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.880
I am counting on you, Tadatsugu.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.380
Leave it to me, Ieyasu.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.850
Fuma, I would like for you to
sow confusion on the battlefield.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.770
Oh! Please wait for me! I am coming, too!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.150
You just wait for me, Mitsunari.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:57.320
Looks like it's going to be a long one, Kojuro.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.690
Yes, Sir.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.660
They have begun their attack.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:08.790
Sound the war drum and send up the flares!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:14.670
Send the entire army to engage the East!

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.510
The Western Forces sent up flares!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:20.050
Here comes the enemy!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:25.260
♪ Oh, may they blossom in battle, ♪

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:31.190
♪ the lives so honed and polished. ♪

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:36.230
♪ We will not vanish as the dew of time. ♪

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.480
Huh?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:42.320
♪ Let's convert to Xavianity. ♪

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.570
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.570
Otomo Army

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.450
This is our chance!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:51.790
We will take advantage of the
chinks in their troubled hearts!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.460
<i>And this is supposed to be the great battle</i>

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.040
<i>that'll determine the future
of the land of the rising sun...</i>

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.670
<i>What are we doing?</i>

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.090
What do I do? What do I do?
What do I do? What do I do? What do I do?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:05.930
What do I do? What do I do? What do I do?

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.390
What do I do? What do I do? What do I do?
What do I do? What do I do?

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:08.180
What do I do? What do I do?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.230
The battle's begun!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.600
