Shimazu Army

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:25.870
Come 'n fight me, Master Tadakatsu!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.370
Where are you, Fuma?!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:39.340
Where are you, my humble self's key?!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:42.210
Where is the man of gloaming feathers?

