00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:42.190
In terms of numbers,
we have the overwhelming advantage.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.650
That paltry force will not
break through our encirclement.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:50.450
The battle has only just begun.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:55.120
Lord Tokugawa should still
have some other ploys at the ready.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.000
You all go as well!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.580
Take as many heads as you can!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.920
The Takeda will not move yet!

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.840
We will discern when the time is right.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:12.350
We do not have the strength to
break through the enemy's encirclement.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:16.310
At this rate, I believe the
momentum will not be in our favor.

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:19.350
Ieyasu, you've got something planned, right?

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.230
Yes, I have thought of our next gambit.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.950
Go, Tadakatsu!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.490
Move out!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:43.380
Th-The warring states' greatest warrior!

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.130
Gyobu!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.890
Honda Tadakatsu,
the warring states' greatest warrior.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:55.350
We cannot just stand by and
let them take command of the skies!

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.480
Send up the flare for Shimazu!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.810
Lord Shimazu!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.810
We got the order to intercept Honda Tadakatsu!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:07.070
'Bout time it came.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.740
The wait's been killin' me.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:13.280
How 'bout we show 'em the depth
of Satsuma's tactical capabilities?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.160
The warring states' greatest warrior
has come within firing range!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.500
Ya just leave 'im to me.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.160
I'll deal with Master Tadakatsu.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.710
Prepare to fire the Satsuma Human Cannon!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:27.420
Light south-southeasterly breeze!
Adjusting firing angle!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.470
Target, Honda Tadakatsu! Fire!

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:36.220
Master Tadakatsu, fight me!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.890
Take that!

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:44.610
That is our Lord Shimazu for you!
He has neutralized Master Honda!

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.900
Gyobu, do not let this opportunity slip by!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.280
Subdue them!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:49.780
It will be done.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.660
Send up the flare for the entire army to charge!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:56.830
To think they had such a dangerous
old geezer up their sleeve, too.

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.740
What do we do?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.790
You still have another gambit?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.120
Your decision, my lord?!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.960
Master Ishida has ordered
the Kobayakawa to charge!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.460
I know that!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.130
I know that, but...

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.800
What do I do?!

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.470
<i>Kingo.</i>

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:15.890
<i>I wish to forge a bond with you as well.</i>

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.470
<i>Man-to-man.</i>

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.100
<i>I will tolerate no treachery!</i>

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.690
<i>Know that when you turn traitor,
it will mean your head!</i>

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.770
What do I do?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.980
What do I do? What do I do?
What do I do? What do I do?

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.020
What do I do? What do I do?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.360
Ieyasu or Mitsunari?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.990
What in the world should I do?!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:37.660
Waaah! Venerable Tenkai!

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.740
The order to charge?!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.160
Never mind that! The key comes first!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.540
Where is Fuma?!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:51.800
Way back when, Ieyasu used
to be this sweet, honest little kid, too.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.300
And I used to play with him, too.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:57.010
But somewhere along the way,

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:01.100
it looks like he started keeping
secrets from both us and Tadakatsu.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:05.190
I want him to depend on me more, you know?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:09.190
I want to do banquets
and world-building, you know?

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.070
I understand.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.820
You are lonely, are you not?

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:15.320
What?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.990
But not to worry.

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:21.990
Lord Xavi will provide you with comfort!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.410
Xavi?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:28.080
Now, let a radical transformation
take place within you!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.000
R-Radical transformation?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.630
Radically transform myself...

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:38.260
From this day forth, your
baptismal name will be Revolution!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.970
Come, let us sing together!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.390
Is this some kind of joke?

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.480
I'm...

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.690
...Revolution!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.320
Revolution!

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:01.580
Now that we have converted
one of their able leaders,

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.870
we have accomplished our goal.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.660
We will now retreat, Muneshige!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.960
Yes, Sir!

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.380
What?!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.250
That was the flare to rush the enemy...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.090
Ignore it.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.590
We will not move.

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:17.010
No movement means no exhaustion.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.890
The time to wield my wits will come later.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.060
Hey! It is wrong to play
around with the almighty sun!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.230
You come down from there!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.350
Irksome little girl...

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:33.730
Reduce her to ashes with the Sun!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:34.980
What?

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:46.620
This is underhanded!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.790
You okay, Tsuru?!

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:52.710
Leave it to me to handle Mori.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:55.630
I've got a score to settle with him.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:58.010
You go settle your own score.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.550
Pirate!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.720
Mori. Kanbei. Otomo. Kingo.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.220
Why do they not advance their armies?!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.600
Gyobu!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:12.900
That is...!

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.230
The enemy does not seem to be moving well.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:20.820
Yeah, looks like the
West's scrum isn't all there.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.320
Who the hell is that?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:30.250
Oh... There is hatred roiling upon this land...

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:31.920
Lord Nobunaga...

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.170
The kings of the East and the West...

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:42.090
...have prepared the
most excellent repast for you.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.930
<i>As Sekigahara fell into utter turmoil,</i>

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.230
<i>yet another army, aligned with neither
East nor West, made its appearance.</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.650
Looks like the battle's already begun.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.780
Both armies seem to be
lacking on the offensive.

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:01.700
No wonder they are at an impasse.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.450
But our objective is not to make war.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:09.410
No, but <i>he</i> should be showing up here as well.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.870
Tenkai, you say?!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:11.710
Yes, Sir.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.630
Tenkai of the Kobayakawa Army
is leading the remnants of the Oda

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.540
and repeatedly attacking as a third force.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.590
That filthy, cursed traitor!

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.930
And where is the Venerable Tenkai?

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:25.800
He is reportedly roughly
in the center of the battlefield.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.020
Lady O-Ichi...

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.770
Kasuga, I'll save you, without fail!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.650
Tenkai has been found!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:47.030
Saika Folk! We will charge
with our entire force!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.780
Our target is Tenkai...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:52.290
No, Akechi Mitsuhide. Him and him alone!

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.830
Pay no heed to any other fighting!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.880
We will not let him return to life!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.000
We will not let him restore that bloody era!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.880
Lord Kingo, the Venerable Tenkai
has been spotted!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:03.880
What?!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.840
Where?!

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.260
Where?! Where?! Where?!
Where?! Where?! Where?!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.050
Where?! Where?! Where?! Where?! Where?!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.640
Where?!

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.100
Oh!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.520
V-Venerable Tenkai!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:18.400
What the...?! The Venerable Tenkai is injured!

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:24.400
Lay off already and give back Kasuga, will you?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.660
I know of no such person.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.580
The Venerable Tenkai is in danger!

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.090
Venerable Tenkai was...

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.550
Venerable Tenkai was the only one...

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.180
...to be...

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.220
...to be nice to me.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:54.560
If the Venerable Tenkai goes away...

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.150
Lord Kingo?

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.980
Everyone...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.610
We're going to go save the Venerable Tenkai!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:15.790
These bastards...

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:18.460
Go!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.500
Follow Lord Kingo's lead!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.380
I... I-I can't stop!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.590
What's that?!

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:34.600
M-M-M-M-M-M... M-Move! Watch out!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.220
R-Run!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.480
I'm sorry!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.190
Has Kobayakawa betrayed us?!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:50.530
Venerable Tenkai!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.240
Lord Kobayakawa has turned traitor!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.620
What did you say?!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.500
Is this true?!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.870
Kingo!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:07.340
You bastard! You would make
Mitsunari suffer further betrayal?!

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:09.380
I will curse you!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:33.280
Come, make your offerings. More flesh and blood!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.320
What the...?

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.120
Akechi Mitsuhide!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.250
The Saika lady, huh?

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:43.460
Oh? The people of Saika, is it?

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:47.050
We will not allow you to make
this world your playground any longer!

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:48.170
Fire!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.350
He wants more blood.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.140
Load the next round!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.940
Th-This is...

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.980
Oh, so it is finally time...

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.230
Aim!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.650
Fire!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.950
Wh-What is that?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:26.210
Now, Lady O-Ichi,
please welcome your elder brother.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.920
Lady O-Ichi!

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.930
<i>You're...</i>

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.810
<i>...Master Akechi...</i>

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:44.730
<i>The one who killed my brother...</i>

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:52.030
No!

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.760
That is as it should be.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:16.970
Soon, this land of Sekigahara,
which Ieyasu and Ishida shaped,

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:21.520
will be filled with the hatred of
the living and the rancor of the dead.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.770
Come, Lady O-Ichi!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.350
A rent that connects to the world beyond!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:29.400
No... No!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.480
No!

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:46.160
Return to life from the world beyond.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:50.250
Come, please awaken, Lord Nobunaga!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.420
O Devil King of the Sixth Heaven!

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.770
Do they mean to desecrate

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:07.850
even this sacred battle
between Ieyasu and myself?!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.440
Damn the Devil King and his men!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.770
Master Ishida.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:15.400
I ask that you order me to battle!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:19.490
I, too, cannot silently
stand by and allow this battle

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.240
to be sullied in this manner!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.790
This I order to Sanada Yukimura!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.170
Thwart this plot of theirs!

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.960
I will! With all my burning soul!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.920
I go now! To battle!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.130
Takeda

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.130
Army

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.130
To Battle

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.230
This is...!

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:48.560
Honnoji Temple...

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.480
I don't like it.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.490
All kinds of hopes and ambitions
have gone into this battle.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:01.030
This thing isn't even clearly of
this world or from the world beyond...

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:04.660
I'll be damned if I let it get in the way.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.870
I'm going, Ieyasu.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.040
I am counting on you, One-Eyed Dragon.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.830
Come with me, Kojuro!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.960
Yes, Sir!

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.430
We're going to get a little rough here!

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:24.640
Let's rumble party! Yeah!

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:32.600
<b>miageyou ima ano Polaris wo</b>

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:32.600
<b>Look up to that Polaris now</b>

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:42.570
<b>kono shinzou wa kokoro wo motazu</b>

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:42.570
<b>My heart doesn' </b>t contain a spirit

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:47.040
<b>nemurenai toki wo kizamu dake da yo</b>

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:47.040
<b>It merely marks the passage of sleepless hours</b>

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:50.830
<b>ryoute de tsuchi wo kakiatsumeta</b>

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:50.830
<b>Scraping up bare earth with my two hands</b>

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:56.090
<b>ano hito no kotoba made ume ya shinai zenshin koso</b>

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:56.090
<b>won' </b>t fill the hole left by that person' s words

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:00.880
<b>jouzu ni karada wo mushibande iku</b>

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:00.880
<b>which are eating up my body</b>

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:09.140
<b>hora goran yo ano Polaris wo</b>

00:22:04.680 --> 00:22:09.140
<b>Just look at that Polaris</b>

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:13.400
<b>uranometoria wo hirogetara</b>

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:13.400
<b>When you open the pages of the Uranometria</b>

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:21.530
<b>yogoreta tenohira ga kiten da to oshiete kureru</b>

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:21.530
<b>It' </b>ll tell you your dirty hands are the reference point

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:26.700
<b>sagasu sagase yo kono samuzora ni</b>

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:26.700
<b>Searching, searching the cold night sky</b>

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:31.160
<b>anata no murui na kagayaki de</b>

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:31.160
<b>for your exceptional brightness</b>

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:44.760
<b>wazuka ni zahyou wo ushinawazu ni koko ni iru no ka</b>

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:44.760
<b>I would have lost the coordinates without you</b>

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:49.930
Life-and-Death

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:49.930
Next time: Life-and-Death
